# H3 (QUALIFICATION): the SHIPPING traffic profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix (audits OFF) with prefix reuse ENGAGED: the gate's agent-turns plan, EIGHT busy coding agents
# at once, growing contexts, each with its own gateway-style salt, so every stream takes the capture and hit path at eight seats on the exact profile production runs.
# H1 and H2 cannot do this (the smoke sends no salt, so reuse is off there). Baseline none. READ: the gate verdict not FAIL and not NOT_EXERCISED (an agent that continued
# reused tokens, Q>0 in the [PREFIX] rows), no host block in execute_trace, no watchdog dump, no garbage or empty stream, no program compiled after the warm.
# Real time: ESTIMATE ~40 (no measured time for this plan; its docker timeout is 9000 s).
# TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the ship/262k-prefix pack (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over that file on a throwaway
# commit of the integration branch (with its evidence files committed) and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Names no rig, card, host or registry. ORDER.txt has
# the order, stop rules, real minutes, NEEDS and the GO rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-10 is the ONE shipping image X0B builds: every job serves it.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-10
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=agent-turns
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=none
C2_PREFIX_AGENTS=8
